// A BASIC USR target. USR passes its integer argument in HL and reads the
// result from HL; a single i16 parameter under the default register ABI
// arrives in HL, so echo() is a single RET. @fastcall keeps the same ABI and
// makes the build fail if the body ever needs the stack or a static slot.

//! expect: echo(42) == 42
//! expect: echo(-32767) == -32767
//! expect-bytes: echo == 1
@fastcall pub i16 echo(i16 value) {
    return value;
}
